{"__inputs":[{"name":"DS_VICTORIAMETRICS","label":"VictoriaMetrics","type":"datasource","pluginId":"prometheus"}],"__requires":[{"type":"grafana","id":"grafana","name":"Grafana","version":"11.0.0"},{"type":"datasource","id":"prometheus","name":"Prometheus","version":"1.0.0"},{"type":"panel","id":"stat","name":"Stat","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"timeseries","name":"Time series","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"table","name":"Table","version":""},{"type":"panel","id":"text","name":"Text","version":""}],"uid":"copilot-cohort-user-attribution","title":"GitHub Copilot AI Adoption Cohort \u2014 User Attribution & Token Budget","description":"Daily AI adoption phase classification per user. Use the phase filter to focus on specific cohorts.","tags":["copilot","cohorts","adoption","attribution"],"timezone":"browser","schemaVersion":39,"version":1,"refresh":"1h","time":{"from":"now-60d","to":"now"},"graphTooltip":1,"templating":{"list":[{"name":"enterprise","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"query":{"query":"label_values(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase, enterprise)","refId":"StandardVariableQuery"},"refresh":2,"multi":false,"includeAll":false,"label":"Enterprise","current":{},"options":[]},{"name":"phase","type":"query","datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"query":{"query":"label_values(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}, ai_adoption_phase)","refId":"StandardVariableQuery"},"refresh":2,"multi":true,"includeAll":true,"allValue":".*","label":"AI Adoption Phase","current":{"selected":true,"text":"All","value":"$__all"},"options":[]}]},"panels":[{"id":1,"type":"text","title":"How to read this dashboard","gridPos":{"h":10,"w":24,"x":0,"y":0},"options":{"mode":"markdown","content":"## AI Adoption Cohort \u2192 User Attribution & Token Budget\n\nGitHub classifies every active Copilot user into an AI Adoption Phase daily, based on which Copilot surfaces they used in the preceding 28-day window.\n\n| Phase | Name | Criteria | Suggested Monthly Token Budget |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0 | No Cohort | Did not meet engagement criteria for any phase | 50,000 |\n| 1 | Code First | Used code completion and/or IDE agent mode | 150,000 |\n| 2 | Agent First | Used one GitHub-based agent surface (cloud agent / code review / CLI) | 400,000 |\n| 3 | Multi-Agent | Used two or more GitHub-based agent surfaces | 1,000,000 |\n\n**Source metric:** `github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{user_login, user_id, ai_adoption_phase}` written daily per user. Use the **AI Adoption Phase** filter above to focus on a specific cohort. Token budget multipliers in the bottom table can be changed directly in the panel query."}},{"id":100,"type":"row","title":"Phase Counts","gridPos":{"h":1,"w":24,"x":0,"y":10},"collapsed":false},{"id":2,"type":"stat","title":"Phase 0 \u2014 No Cohort","description":"Number of distinct users currently classified as No Cohort \u2014 did not meet engagement criteria for any phase in the preceding 28-day window. These are the primary activation targets.","gridPos":{"h":4,"w":6,"x":0,"y":11},"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"},"targets":[{"expr":"count(last_over_time(github_copilot_user_ai_adoption_phase{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=~\".*No Cohort.*\"}[$__range]))","instant":true,"refId":"A","editorMode":"code","legendFormat":""}],"fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"mode":"fixed","fixedColor":"#EAB308"},"decimals":0,"mappings":[],"thresholds":{"mode":"absolute","steps":[{"color":"purple","value":0}]},"unit":"none"},"overrides":[]},"options":{"colorMode":"background","graphMode":"area","justifyMode":"auto","orientation":"auto","percentChangeColorMode":"standard","reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"],"fields":"","values":false},"showPercentChange":false,"textMode":"auto","wideLayout":true}},{"id":3,"type":"stat","title":"Phase 1 \u2014 Code First","description":"Number of users who used